{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115051","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115051/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115051/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115051/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115051","id":3824049189,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7j7lwl","number":115051,"title":"Jolt Physics 3D: joint is unstable when RigidBody3D in kinematic mode is moved with AnimationPlayer","user":{"login":"patrykkalinowski","id":7796424,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTY0MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7796424?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski","html_url":"https://github.com/patrykkalinowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-01-17T00:04:41Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T09:05:18Z","closed_at":"2026-02-14T20:24:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6.rc1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.rc1 - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8142) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600X 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 63.92 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf RigidBody3D is joined to big Kinematic RigidBody3D (freeze mode = kinematic), and kinematic rigidbody is moved through animation, joint is not stable and goes into oscillation or jitter (longer oscillation when joint's origin is close to big rigidbody, smaller jigger if it's close to small body)\n\nThis is visible when distance between two bodies' origin is at least several meters\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMinimal reproduction project contains a scene showing two windows side by side.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca79b002-5680-4932-9f83-f7a5d8cff66e\n\nOn the left, Window 1 is kinematic RigidBody (green box) moved using code:\n```\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tglobal_transform = global_transform.translated(Vector3.RIGHT * delta * 10)\n\tglobal_transform = global_transform.rotated(Vector3.UP, deg_to_rad(0.1))\n```\nThis works as expected and joint is stable\n\n---\n\nOn the right, Window 2 is the same scene, but kinematic RigidBody is moved with animation (AnimationPlayer in Physics callback mode). You can see how small RigidBody jitters. If you move 6DOFJoint closer to big RigidBody's origin (closer to wall), jitter will become oscillations.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[animation-player-physics-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24683590/animation-player-physics-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"patrykkalinowski","id":7796424,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTY0MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7796424?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski","html_url":"https://github.com/patrykkalinowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115051/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115051/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}